1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,200
Build and share an exhibition. At least three items in your Vault. About 3 minutes.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:12,600
Create First Exhibition. Open Exhibitions and choose Create First Exhibition.

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:19,600
Title and description. Give it a title and a short description.

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:27,100
Choose who can see it. Start with Private while you build. You can open it up later.

5
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:33,600
Create Exhibition. Then choose Create Exhibition.

6
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:40,600
Your exhibition page. Your exhibition is created, private and ready to fill.

7
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:48,600
Edit/Add. Choose Edit/Add to pick items from your Vault.

8
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:56,600
Choose items. Tick the items you want. A tick shows each item that is selected.

9
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:03,600
Add to Exhibit. Choose Add to Exhibit. The number shows how many items you picked.

10
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:11,600
Review and save. Your items sit on the shelf. Choose Save.

11
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:19,600
Preview as a visitor. Open the guest preview to see what visitors will see.

12
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:27,600
Choose visibility. Choose Public Exhibit, then confirm Make public.

13
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:36,600
Share it. The exhibition is Public. Choose Copy Link, or use a share button.

14
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:43,500
Your exhibition is public and ready to share. Next: import more of your collection with a spreadsheet.
